mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100.0</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>, yielding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>100.0</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow></math> behind the converging optical center (real, inverted image on the opposite side; Option A wrongly uses +u instead of -u).</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Recreated Clean Vector SVG Diagram (100% Copyright-Safe)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>73b805fca514fddbfd97...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248333 · SUBSCIPHYS_Q489314</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq-db\">DB2_PYQ</span>\n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-fig\">🖼️ Figure / Diagram</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_SCI_PHYSICS — Physics (Classical Mechanics, Electromagnetism, Quantum, Optics &amp; Solid State)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff easy\">Easy</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: NEET UG / JEE Main Physics (2023)</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: NTA · ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Science</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Ray Optics &amp; Optical Instruments</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Thin Convex Lens Image Formation &amp; Ray Tracing</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>As illustrated in the ray diagram, a real object is placed at distance <math xmln