ss=\"opt-text\">+25.0 cm</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">+150.0 cm</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Using Cartesian sign convention <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>75.0</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>75.0</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>, yielding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>150.0</mn><mtext> cm</mtext></mrow></math> behind the converging optical center (real, inverted image on the opposite side; Option A wrongly uses +u instead of -u).</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> Recreated Clean Vector SVG Diagram (100% Copyright-Safe)</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>943aabbeb20997088d90...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    "}
